from pathlib import Path
import json,hashlib
ROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1];OUT=ROOT/'build/fullgame/boss_speed_r53'
def main():
 s=json.loads((OUT/'validation_summary.json').read_text());assert s['passed'];archive=OUT/'RType_TS2068_r53.zip';digest=hashlib.sha256(archive.read_bytes()).hexdigest();rows=s['movement_comparison'];l5=rows[4];cache=s['reports']['cache_progression_validation.json'];boss=s['reports']['boss_preview_validation.json']['results'];timing=s['composition_timing'];draw=s['reports']['drawing_validation.json']['reports']
 section='\n\n## Final standard-build measurements\n\nSame 480-refresh held-movement/8-short-press/one-charged-hold route per level. Death bypass isolates sustained input. Main-update counts are included to distinguish input cadence from scene animation; restored periodic interrupts change timer/attack work, so they are not an identical-scene FPS benchmark.\n\n| Level | Player ticks r52 / r53 | Short shots r52 / r53 | Main updates r52 / r53 |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n'
 for r in rows:section+=f'| {r["level"]} | {r["old_ticks"]} / {r["new_ticks"]} | {r["old_shots"]} / {r["new_shots"]} | {r["old_world_updates"]} / {r["new_world_updates"]} |\n'
 section+=f'\nFull resident-cache/ending/revisit route: {cache["frames"]} refreshes. L5 player ticks improve {l5["new_ticks"]/l5["old_ticks"]:.2f}x; all eight short presses and the charged hold register on every level. Standard separate-stack low-water mark in the input/fire profiles is 5BA4, above the 5B60 reserved lower bound. L5 main scene animation remains a bottleneck; the update counts explicitly do not show an across-the-board animation-rate increase.\n\nPackage: `build/fullgame/boss_speed_r53/RType_TS2068_r53.zip`, SHA256 `{digest}`. Physical validation pending.\n'
 doc=ROOT/'docs/r53_boss_speed.md';text=doc.read_text();assert '## Final standard-build measurements'not in text;doc.write_text(text+section,encoding='utf-8')
 history=f"""\n\n## 115 - Standard boss rendering/input scheduling, r53 (2026-11-04)

User's standard compact L5 movement stall reproduced. Original DI shader plus half-rate IRQ publication caused {l5['old_ticks']} player ticks in 480 refreshes on the movement/fire route, only {l5['old_shots']} of eight short shots. Separate HOME IRQ stack, raw banked interrupted-stack preservation, temporary DOCK4 IM2 table and carefully DI bank/stack transitions make visible L5 cell work interruptible. All source artwork/dimensions/normal-black palette data unchanged; standard24px spheres/80pxcore retained. HOME5B60..5BBF IRQ stack,5B5B vector trampoline,5BCE raw SP; original HOME5D reverse table preserved. Temporary vector high byte at asserted-zero DOCK4:9000 restored with I84 before return; bank4 core scratch moved8BF0..8BFF. Engine2372bytes, gateway165, shader769; low helper gaps statically FF-checked.

L5 cell-opacity rejection moved before interrupt setup/source decoding. New covered-row path advances source without row decode/blending. Unowned direction/flash and owned row pointer direction chosen once per cell; no extra compositor pass/whole-screen overlap scan. Same25native captured actor draws {timing[0]['cycles']} -> {timing[1]['cycles']}cycles, source overlap rows {timing[0]['decoded_overlap_rows']} -> {timing[1]['decoded_overlap_rows']}. Synthetic384cases total{ s['reports']['compiled_equivalence.json']['total_old_cycles']} -> {s['reports']['compiled_equivalence.json']['total_new_cycles']}cycles (0.41% extra safety/setup in that different workload, not a universal speed gain). All8boss palette lookup removes redundant saves and uses register-preserving byte range checks;5088direct/retained native draw cases exact across observed descriptors/flips/clips/flash, about6-7% less draw CPU in those samples.524288native source pointers verified.384independent compact coverage cases and384byte-exact r52cases pass.7565interrupt injections across sphere/core/orientations/overlaps preserve maps/stacks/registers/draws; audio/input scan stubbed only for this boundary test. Real audio/input tested in full routes.

Unrestricted full-rate publication candidate retained locally in boss_input_priority_r53, NOT shipped as standard: it improved input but consumed scene CPU. Standard samples fire edges on every accepted active-game IRQ, including backing-capture busy periods, with alternate-IRQ player publication and original half-rate charge count. Inactive guard prevents gameplay scans/queuing on menus. Chosen key definition, merged native joystick ports, fine1px/held5px steps retained. Matched L5final {l5['new_ticks']}ticks/480refreshes,8of8shortshots+1beam; all8levels8shots+1beam. L5mainupdates{l5['old_world_updates']}->{l5['new_world_updates']}, so no whole-game FPS claim: restoring periodic audio/timers and responsive input consumes CPU. Full profiles/table in docs/r53_boss_speed.md and validation_summary.json; no hardware result claimed.

Development failures retained in diagnostics/logs and superseded: first IRQ prefix guard rejected the intentional new low stack; real stack-switch race then exposed by BAD SP, fixed DI before both bank/SP transitions. A row-step optimization clobbered DE and failed coverage, fixed preservation. A longer JR failed assembly; subsequently invoked stale tests were invalid and not release evidence. Full-rate short holds crossed the old charge threshold, fixed half-rate charge timing. IRQ comparator initially included intentionally changing native timer bytes; restricted to actual planes/ownership/register contracts. A cold input-scan fixture entered uninitialized game paths; boundary-only test now uses explicit scan/audio stubs, with separate real-input game routes. Movement4px edge clamp at x224 was legitimate and added to its harness. Inactive IRQ capture now separately guarded. No failing prototype is the packaged game.

Final frozen serial gates:7565IRQ cases;524288classifier pointers;384independent+384exactL5composition;5088allbossdrawcases;894player ticks+retained/frozen/empty/collision tests; actual selected keys/bothjoysticks;8normal+1chargedfire; real death/respawn;116title states;L1snake;selected3/8restarts;fourloaderfailures;all8boss700updates;full8residentcache/ending/revisit {cache['frames']}refreshes. Final boss refreshes {[(v['level'],v['frame'])for v in boss]}. Phase/cache/source art ownership and72pages/XOR/hash/ZIP checked. No new diagnostic images: byte-identical rendering required, native binary/profile captures retained. Original archives/reference projects unchanged. Stock64KBread-only cartridge unchanged.

Deliverable build/fullgame/boss_speed_r53/RType_TS2068_r53.zip SHA256 {digest}. Complete matching RTYPEfolder, reset/reload required, older large-art level not compatible. Hardware validation pending.
"""
 h=ROOT/'TEST_HISTORY.md';assert b'## 115 -'not in h.read_bytes();h.open('ab').write(history.encode('utf-8'))
 state=f"""\n\n## Latest packaged build: r53 (2026-11-04)

Standard compact L5 input starvation repaired with bank/stack-safe interruptible visible-cell drawing. Active-game fire edges sampled even during busy/alternate IRQs; player publication budgeted to alternate IRQs, preserving scene budget and charge timing. Selected keys/both native joysticks retained. Matched L5{l5['old_ticks']}->{l5['new_ticks']}player updates/480refreshes and{l5['old_shots']}->8shortshots; all8levels8shots+1beam. L5covered rows skip source decode/blend; captured25draws2.48%lessCPU,1064->554decodedoverlaprows. Shared all8boss palette lookup about6-7%cheaper in5088exactnative draw cases. Art/dimensions unchanged. No constant worldFPS claim; L5sceneanimation stillslow.

Final serial gates pass:7565IRQ boundary injections,524288source pointers,384independent+384exactL5cases,894player ticks, chosencontrols/joysticks/fire/death/title116/snake/restarts/errors, all8boss700updates and full8residentcache/ending/revisit{cache['frames']}refreshes.72pages+ZIP/staticownedranges verified. Full-rate-publication candidate rejected from standard due sceneCPU tradeoff, retained locally as diagnostic. Stock64KBROM unchanged; hardware validation pending. docs/r53_boss_speed.md and TEST_HISTORY115.

Deliverable build/fullgame/boss_speed_r53/RType_TS2068_r53.zip SHA256 {digest}. Replace matching RTYPEfolder and reset before RTFULL.TAP; do not mix old large-art level files.
"""
 (ROOT/'PROJECT_STATE.md').open('ab').write(state.encode('utf-8'));print(digest)
